\item[S2] Andrej Dujella, Diophantine m-tuples, author-maintained survey (snapshot accessed 9 October 2026), Section 3.1, Conjecture 3.1. \url{https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dujella/dujella.github.io/master/dn.html}.
